{"message":"The table reconciles changes in asset retirement liability for fiscal 2003. Net change is ending liability at Sept 27 2003 minus beginning liability at Sept 29 2002: 7.2 - 5.5 = 1.7 million. Alternatively, additional obligations of 0.5 plus accretion of 1.2 also equal 1.7 million.","tool":"calculate","arguments":{"expression":"7.2 - 5.5","sources":{"7.2":"source:t3c1n0","5.5":"source:t0c1n0"}}}